Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["17. Falsification conditions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f4b52e1d-37cb-d54f-aa19-259613ee9318"],

Cell["A serious framework must specify failure cases.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d72e3eb-8805-964d-a458-885ce595f0b0"],

Cell["This framework is under pressure if:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"29cc4f77-4ab1-404e-8bbc-0dde63e41167"],

Cell["\<\
1. spectral stability and scale robustness systematically disagree,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"039e558d-34eb-a046-97cb-4baa416f1016"],

Cell["\<\
2. selection stability never correlates with spectral persistence,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fdfb2eb4-1d55-0846-be3b-d0f8b447c9fe"],

Cell["\<\
3. visually appealing \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]pockets\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
are not stationary or metastable under quantitative tests,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e8305f8a-9a33-a943-845f-d3ba516ec493"],

Cell["\<\
4. apparent vortex-like structure has no nontrivial curl, winding, or \
topological signature,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a7fd2bd0-1e81-4347-8cf0-161eda0a4d70"],

Cell["\<\
5. conclusions drift strongly with truncation or discretization refinement. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6cddc5f6-3d7e-f347-a7dc-7e2332914b4d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{0},
      "Spacer1"]},
